// ===========================================================================
// games/sonic4/data/sound/mt_bank_blob.emp — the Moving-Trucks streaming bank
// body, native (K4 inc-5 Stage 3, the P2 MT probe)
// ===========================================================================
// The Moving-Trucks song-stream bank was the BINCLUDE at $58607 in main.asm's
// gameSoundDataIncludes (inside the sound bank, after the phased soundBankHead).
// This module places it NATIVELY by EMBEDDING the seam-2-emitted mt_bank{,_debug}
// .bin — the P2 path (spec §6): the emit-tool architecture is untouched
// (`ensure_generated` still lowers mt_bank.emp → the .bin); this module just
// places those bytes natively instead of via AS BINCLUDE.
//
// SHAPE-DEPENDENT SIZE (shape-INVARIANT start): the body always starts at $58607
// (the soundBankHead above it is $607 bytes both shapes), but the debug build
// adds the DrumTest + HCZ2 songs, so plain is 0x34E1 B (ends $5BAE8) and debug is
// 0x4F33 B (ends $5D53A). The embed selects on DEBUG.
//
// NON-PHASED: the body's labels are plain LMA (68k reads SongTable/SongPatchTable
// at their absolute ROM
// addresses; the Z80 reads the song streams via runtime-computed window pointers
// baked into the .bin, not via fixed phased labels). So this is a plain-LMA embed
// section, like the DAC — NOT a `bank: $8000` phase section.
//
// SongTable / SongPatchTable (the two labels sound_api.emp consumes cross-seam via
// `extern`) sit in the last SONG_COUNT*8 bytes of the blob (SONG_COUNT = 1 plain /
// 3 debug — a shape-dependent mid-blob offset a single `embed()` cannot label), so
// they stay AS-provided by the emitted `mt_syms{,_debug}.asm` (an emitted artifact,
// like the .bin). This module owns the BYTES + the head label Song_MovingTrucks
// (the section head / map-order / frozen boundary key; no runtime consumer).
//
// STRUCTURAL EXCLUSIVITY (spec §6, the ruled mechanism, inherited from Stage 2):
// this native section is the SOLE MT-body placement — the AS BINCLUDE is DELETED
// (can't-both), the section is unconditional in the sound-on registry
// (can't-neither). Placement is map-driven (the sound_bank anchor + contiguous
// pack), which is what lands the SFX block correctly after this region.
// ===========================================================================

module games.sonic4.mt_bank_blob in mt_bank_blob

const _mt       = embed("engine/sound/generated/mt_bank.bin")
const _mt_debug = embed("engine/sound/generated/mt_bank_debug.bin")

// The whole Moving-Trucks streaming bank body (song streams + patch bank + pitch
// table + the SongTable/SongPatchTable pointer tables) @ $58607.
pub data Song_MovingTrucks = if DEBUG == 1 { _mt_debug } else { _mt }
